     "<div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On 27 September 2012 13:56, Hadley Wickham <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">h.wi...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">You need to put the + on the previous line<div>Hadley<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Sep 27, 2012 at 7:37 PM, Guillermo Bueno <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cgbu...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\">I have the following plot:</span><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<br>caption &lt;- paste(strwrap(&quot;Disturbance intensity of 4.95 cubic meters&quot;))<br><br>qplot(INT,Fit.NH4,  data=<a href=\"http://suelo.int\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://suelo.int&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374565226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3fOjQKvmEhuRDyyDXaqblk\">suelo.int</a>, geom =&quot;smooth&quot;,<br>      ylab=&quot;Fitted Values&quot;, xlab=&quot;log(Disturbance intensity)&quot;<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n      , main=expression(paste(plain(&quot;Ammonium concentration (&quot;) * mu<br>      , plain(&quot;g N/g resin)&quot;)))) + geom_vline(xintercept = 1.6, colour=&quot;black&quot;)<br>    <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,51)\">  + geom_text(aes(label=caption), position c(x=1.3,y=1))</span></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,51)\"><img alt=\"Inline images 1\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\">\r\n\r\n\r\nthe error says something like: &quot;no valid argument for a unitary operator&quot;<br><br>I want to add the text vertically to the vertical line that I&#39;ve created.<br></div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<br></div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\">any suggestion?</div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\">thanks a lot in advance!!</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\">\r\n\r\n\r\nGuillermo</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial\"><br></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br>\r\nPlease provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374565226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JyY4mGNk-8Z5wTX4V94hJ\">https://github.com/hadley/devtools/wiki/Reproducibility</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nTo post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nTo unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\nMore options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374565226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QbOwHsd67Zr5OhnhobIjD\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br>\r\n</font></span></font></span></blockquote></div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br>RStudio / Rice University<br><a href=\"http://had.co.nz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://had.co.nz/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792374565226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0vlOmqyfivMk90KKcjONkf\">http://ha